# Root documents ruled as deliberate residents under the document placement
# standard (claude-settings/workspace/proposals/2026-07-13-doc-placement-standard.md,
# ratified 2026-07-27). One filename per line; '#' starts a comment.
#
# Machine-prose rulings. "this machine"/"this host" below is resolved by the
# READER — a bind-option label, the host being deployed to, or a step on the
# reader's own machine — so it is correct on every clone and is not the
# writer-resolved deixis the check exists to catch.
machine-prose: README.md
